{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39575","headline":"蒙闽王改赐乡里 · 翁承赞","name":"蒙闽王改赐乡里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡名文秀里光贤，别向钧台造化权。\n阀阅便因今日贵，德音兼与後人传。\n自从受赐身无力，向未酬恩骨肯镌。\n归阙路遥心更切，不嫌扶病倚旌旃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}